<title>NETHERLANDS: ING Barings raises Heineken EPS estimates.</title>
<headline>ING Barings raises Heineken EPS estimates.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of March 17 research.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>Heineken	  Brewing	 338.00  ING Barings</p>
<p>COMMENT: 1996 results and 1997 outlook to improve sentiment. Mix improvement (switch from standard to premium/specialty beers) developed strongly in 1996. Pofit statement for 1997 healthy, given early time of year and increased competition. Heineken stock valued below averages in Dutch food &amp; beverage sector and international brewer basket. Average valuation would lead to share price of NLG 360.00. EPS estimates raised, and Buy recommandation maintained.</p>
<p>    Estimates (NLG):  EPS     pvs EPS   P/E	Dividend</p>
<p>    1996 (actual)     13.06   n.a.	25.9     3.50</p>
<p>    1997		  14.35   13.05     23.6     n.a.</p>
<p>    1998		  15.80   15.60     21.4     n.a.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
